  "description": "Born into a cursed noble family, Claude Ambrosia grows up to become the villain who destroys the empire in the novel “Flower of Darkness.” Enter Sarah Millen, the writer of this story, who is determined to change Claude’s tragic ending as his new nanny. Though cold to her at first, Claude slowly opens up to Sarah, who encourages the young boy to see his distant father, Duke Ethan Ambrosia. Can Sarah help this father and son heal? Or will the curse that haunts this family spell doom for them all? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
